                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Gray-brown to dark, springs away when touched</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Bathrooms, basements, sinks, potted plants</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Persistent moisture</td>
                  </tr>
