                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Vacuum baseboards, closets and under furniture regularly</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Removes lint, pet hair and dead insects larvae feed on</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Carpet beetles, fleas</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Keep pets on vet-recommended flea and tick prevention</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Stops the pet carrying in a population</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Fleas, brown dog ticks</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Fix leaks and wipe up spills promptly</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Removes the water source</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Cockroaches, ants, springtails</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Inspect secondhand furniture and luggage after travel</td>
